			"title": "{jiraKey}: [i18n] Saas-mfe-access-request module updated message bundles.",
			"description": "New translated message bundles from OneSky. This issue is automatically generated by the 'acmeTranslate' command.\n\nThe on call engineer should:\n1. Review that this PR is properly formatted JSON and that the variables used within phrases are syntactically valid. If they are not please raise the issue in the #proj-saas-translations slack channel and do not merge this until they are resolved.\n2. Assuming the PR is good, merge this PR.\n3. Follow the link below to the jira ticket for this PR\n   - Move it to your scrum's jira project.\n   - Assign it to yourself.\n   - Transition the issue to the \"Pre Release\" state.\n\n{jiraUrl}",
			"labels": ["feature-flag-exempt"]
		}
	},

